  "notes": "One DT 8 unit: two permanently coupled cars (Bo'Bo'+Bo'Bo', all axles powered) on the Stuttgart Stadtbahn, high-floor. Per unit (infobox, DT 8.16-17): length over coupling 39.11 m, 98 seats incl. 24 folding, 156 standing; the article text gives 'room for 250 people' for DT 8.16, so total is left to seated + standing (254) and standing density is not stated. Capacity is per consist. Traction 8 x 130 kW continuous per unit. Four doors per side per 40 m unit as described for the series. Acceleration is given only as a range (0.9-1.3 m/s2), so left null; deceleration, empty weight of DT 8.16 and floor height of DT 8.16 (stated as 3 cm lower than the 1000 mm of predecessors) left null. A published price exists only for the earlier DT 8.15 series, so no cost is given for this model."
